Agent & Service Partner Onboarding
Field Specification | Bee / Zivion
Purpose: define the fields and workflow for registering an agent or service company, then requesting property assignments for Zivion Admin approval.
Workflow Overview
•	Stage 1 — Agent and Company Registration: personal information, company details, contact details, services offered, and documents.
•	Stage 2 — Property Assignment: select properties, areas, approved service categories, and assignment dates.
•	Approval — Zivion Admin reviews the property assignment request before access is activated.
Key rule: company registration approval and property assignment approval are separate. Submitting a request must not grant property access automatically.
