Assignment Type options: Single Property; Multiple Properties; Property Portfolio; Temporary / Project-Based Assignment.
Only services registered in Stage 1 should be selectable. Admin must be able to approve a subset of services per property.
8. Multiple Property Assignment
Provide a “+ Add Another Property” action. Each property assignment should be a separate record with its own property, tower/block/zone, approved services, dates, sponsor, documents, status, and approval details. This allows one company to serve several communities without duplicating its company registration.
