Approval Decision options: Approve; Approve with Restrictions; Request Changes; Reject.
Assignment status options: Draft; Submitted for Approval; Under Review; Changes Requested; Approved; Approved with Restrictions; Rejected; Suspended; Expired; Revoked.
Workflow
•	1. Agent submits personal, company, contact, service, and document details.
•	2. Registration is saved and validated. Any required initial verification is completed.
•	3. Agent / company requests one or more property assignments.
•	4. Submission creates a request in the Zivion Admin approval queue.
•	5. Zivion Admin verifies the company, documents, services, and property scope.
•	6. Admin approves, approves with restrictions, requests changes, or rejects.
•	7. Only approved property/service permissions are activated.
Recommended System Rules
•	Maintain one company profile with multiple property assignments; do not duplicate company registration per property.
•	Store each offered service as a reusable related record and permit only registered services to be requested for a property.
•	Do not grant property access on submission; activate access only after approval.
•	Support partial approval of properties, services, and areas.
•	Record changes to company details, services, documents, and assignments in an audit history.
•	Expired or revoked assignments must no longer grant access.
•	Keep company verification separate from property assignment approval.
•	Property assignment defines where the agent may work; role-based permissions define what the agent may do.
•	Collect sensitive identity information only when required, and restrict document access to authorized users.
Suggested Data Entities (Implementation Reference)
Entity	Example Fields
Agent / User	Name, contact details, login identity, account status
Organization / Company	Company identity, registration, address, status
Agent Employment / Contact	Agent, employer, designation, manager, dates
Service Offering	Company, service category, specialization, description, certifications
Agent Document	Document type, secure file reference, expiry, verification status
Property Assignment	Agent/company, property, area, services, dates, status
Assignment Approval	Request, reviewer, decision, restrictions, timestamps
Audit History	Actor, action, timestamp, changed fields

End of document
